# React Native

- Use functional components.
- Use hooks.
- Do not use class components.
- Keep JSX readable.
- Extract complex JSX into smaller components.
- Do not put business logic inside UI components.
- Do not put persistence logic inside UI components.
- Do not put API logic inside UI components.
- Reuse shared components whenever possible.
- Reuse theme tokens.
- Avoid unnecessary inline styles.
- Avoid unnecessary re-renders.
- Keep platform-specific logic isolated.
- Prefer composition over large configurable components.